  "history": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "Shen Shang shows Fang Yuan the Immortal Gu he created, Heal Injury: a pure human path Immortal Gu and a genuine rank eight, shaped like a silkworm, pale yellow and curled into a ball.",
        "chapters": [
          1914
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "intro",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_shen_shang",
          "char_fang_yuan",
          "sys_immortal_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Shen Shang’s memory is fragmented, and what he remembers is limited. He used to major in sound path, then in an accident refined heal injury Immortal Gu, and from that Gu saw hope of human path.",
        "chapters": [
          1915
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "intro",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "Given a chance by Paradise Earth to atone, Shen Shang had entered the blue dragon whale to cultivate, built those killer moves on heal injury Immortal Gu, then created the killer move countless injury marks and changed his vital Gu to injury mark Immortal Gu.",
        "chapters": [
          2197
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
